yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T03:00:28-07:00","id":521500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/519588-mummies-and-the-creation-of-the-sahara?p=520613#post520613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That definitely has some cool implications there! From what I've read in the last day and a bit, the 5.9 Kiloyear event did impact the Arabian Peninsula, so its not inconceivable of having reached all the way to Sumeria.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very much so, I posted this elsewhere but...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ubaid_period\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Bowl_MET_DP104228_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Bowl_MET_DP104228_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ubaid_period\" target=\"_blank\"> Ubaid period - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ubaid_period\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ubaid_period </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 'The archaeological record shows that Arabian Bifacial/Ubaid period came to an abrupt end in eastern Arabia and the Oman peninsula at 3800 BC, just after the phase of lake lowering and onset of dune reactivation.<sup><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ubaid_period#cite_note-Parker2006-14\" target=\"_blank\">[14]</a></sup> At this time, increased aridity led to an end in semi-desert nomadism, and there is no evidence of human presence in the area for approximately 1000 years, the so-called &quot;Dark Millennium&quot;.<sup><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ubaid_period#cite_note-Uerpmann2002-15\" target=\"_blank\">[15]</a></sup> This might be due to the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5.9_kiloyear_event\" target=\"_blank\">5.9 kiloyear event</a> at the end of the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Older_Peron\" target=\"_blank\">Older Peron</a>.'<br /> <br /> ... or it could be down to ultra metal demon death sorcerers. Six of one, half-dozen of the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T03:23:02-07:00","id":521549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></d